# Figures copied into the manuscript from the analysis tree.
#
#   <dest under figures/>        <source, relative to `analysis_root` in the justfile>
#
# `just figures` copies source -> dest for every row. `just check` byte-compares
# them and reports drift, which is the trap this file exists to close: a
# re-analysis updates the plot in the analysis tree and leaves the copy in
# figures/ untouched, so the manuscript keeps rendering a figure that no longer
# matches its own numbers, with nothing to flag it.
#
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored. Whitespace-separated, so paths must not
# contain spaces.

example_figure.png        example_figure.png
